      "widgets_values": [
        "Sometimes I prefer the artistic composition of an older SDXL model.\nThis workflow creates an image with SDXL from a common prompt, and then feeds that image into Qwen 2.1 as a reference image, and refers to the original prompt which is enhanced and generates a new image\n\nAdjust temperature in prompt enhancer loader to control how much of the original images used the lower the number the more of the image is used"
